A||||3||batboy||89 Corsica 2.5 in a 87 Fiero?
Z||000000||batboy||08-05-99||11:32 PM||||I know we've discussed putting a later model 2.5 into an older Fiero before. Ogre and a couple others seem to think that since my 87 2.5 car has the DIS ignition and newer TBI, that it PROBABLY could be swapped in with minimal problems. I now have a chance to buy a one owner 89 Corsica (with maintainence records) very, very cheaply that has an excellent drive train, but the car got rear ended by a hit and run driver. Can anyone think of potential problems in this swap. Another neat thing is that the car has an overdrive tranny. I figure that's not a bolt in swap, but I can't help but wonder how hard it would be to swap that sucker in too at the same time. Lots of great parts on this car, great working A/C, etc...
Z||000001||theogre||08-06-99||08:28 AM||||the motor should only need pully & bracket changes. take off the are cleaner and make sure they both have the same TBI. The 700 used in 87 Fiero looks completely diferant than the old one. They should both have DIS, but check. All 87 Fiero's have DIS, but not all other GM's do. The coil pack for DIS sits where the Dist goes. You can't miss it.<p>The tranny will likely need some work on the shifter arm. The FWD trannys use diferent bracket work. I'm not sure if the 87 tranny support braket fits any other GM units. You could have dificulty with mounts. You might have to do some work on the shifter as well. You'll only find out what, if anything, after the thing is in the car.<p>I'd park the 2 cars next to each other and look them over real good. You should be able to see fairly quickly what's diferant.
Z||000002||batboy||08-06-99||08:14 PM||||Guess what? I went back to look at that Corsica a second time and discovered that it is not a 2.5 liter. Boy is my face red *blush* it's a 2.2 liter. I know the motors don't look anything alike, but they told me over the phone it was a 2.5 so I belived them. I told them I was no longer interested in the car, so everyone can disregard this thread.
Z||000003||Cooter||08-06-99||09:40 PM||||If it is the same style 2.2 that is in grandpaw's s-10 truck, it is more of a dog than the 2.5! I think that I could chain bumpers with my lawn mower and pull that poor truck backward! Good idea to let that one go.
